    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out. my dad, his brother, even my grandfather... they all hit this same wall. it's like there's this darkness built into my actual cells. i'm just a walking timer and i don't see the point in trying to outrun something that's already written in my dna.",
